{"time": 1756627975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765893369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（军医出列（）"}
{"time": 1756628013, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2093852453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“还活着一位呢，叫赵九明，只是这里”他指了指脑袋“出了些问题”"}
{"time": 1756628070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56136022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“现在口里尽是些疯话，没啥办法沟通，我们让他在营房里先歇着呢，其他士兵也不敢过去和他待在一起”"}
{"time": 1756628082, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243994879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“能让我看看吗，我是军医，赵九明兄弟和刚刚去世的那几位兄弟我都想看看”"}
{"time": 1756628108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481474955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "（要收拾第二箱了）"}
{"time": 1756628154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962250397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“我代九明兄弟先谢过这位大夫了。只是还有些情报还未跟你们交代清楚。”"}
{"time": 1756628244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63510750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“您先说，等您说完我们就去看看情况”"}
{"time": 1756628320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199390516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“买卖城内我怀疑有黑喇嘛和毛子的探子，老毛子们待在城北，之前还发生过械斗，只是我们的人赶过去的时候被掩饰过去了。还有人疑似目击到了黑喇嘛的骑兵，手上拿着奇怪的人骨法器”"}
{"time": 1756628356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539749931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“我猜啊，如果黑喇嘛惦记着买卖城，那就肯定不止有城外的骑兵，城内也一定有人”"}
{"time": 1756628408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2057862300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "饭菜刚刚热好，两位小兄弟把饭菜端了上来"}
{"time": 1756628427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50895856", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"敢这么杀我们的人。\"暂时不动筷子，\"这些人还真是越来越大胆了。\""}
{"time": 1756628443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1760672345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "（可以吃，可以之后啃干粮，也可以先去看赵九明回来再吃）"}
