{"time": 1756648726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1340888179", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=911627106]当你靠近他时，似乎能够听到他碎碎念着“死了、好可怕好可怕”"}
{"time": 1756648845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325213127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "夏虫医生走了过来试图用语言安抚赵九明，在你的成功安抚下他似乎开始平静了下来"}
{"time": 1756648851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "708565098", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "断断续续地开始描述"}
{"time": 1756648895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "752603317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“有个裹着大衣的阔佬……弄得商铺都要断货了。我们在缺货前买到了东西，聚在营房里。”"}
{"time": 1756648979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746238063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "而就在这时，大大咧咧的雇佣兵毛妹操着带有奇特口音的中文接茬道“没有好怕的，不就是，野兽爪”"}
{"time": 1756649044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682837585", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "好在夏虫医生快速地捂住了虹鹭的嘴，但医生也能从赵九明的眼神中看出来那深深的恐惧，这次安抚恐怕要无功而返了"}
{"time": 1756649079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841423810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "他迅速地把身体又缩成一团“寒风，好可怕，我不敢回头看。死了，都死了。”"}
{"time": 1756649106, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968280953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "（能不能打晕了再安抚一次）"}
