{"time": 1756654278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "485607721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“哦对了，那边那个被吓坏了的怂蛋，小赵？开枪之前我要问你，你躲起来蹲下的时候，有听到枪声吗？……”"}
{"time": 1756654393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1645932663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "他吓坏了，完全没有回应了。但是随着你们进来的那个蹲下的士兵回应到“没有枪声，吃饭的时候枪都放在营房外面了”"}
{"time": 1756654398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016622071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“还有老顾？作为军爷，我最后再问你一句，你不会阻止我开枪的，对吧？”"}
{"time": 1756654434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791058306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还没当开枪的时候\""}
