{"time": 1756655730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1854195248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“发生什么了，怎么开枪了！都没事吧！”传来了吴连长的声音"}
{"time": 1756655733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830064102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "对是否要开枪持观望态度，但既然解决了事态，自己也就不说什么了"}
{"time": 1756655737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363438920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1890888042]有些冷静下来，于是点点头"}
{"time": 1756655833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036466061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1854195248]看向顾营长让他说明"}
{"time": 1756655846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919206276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "随后就是门把手转动的声音，吴连长左手手持着一个火把，右手拿着手枪，把门推开了"}
{"time": 1756655854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "109787568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "（直接进来了）"}
{"time": 1756655917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2036987201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "他看了一圈，没有发现什么异况，松了口气，“我还以为又有袭击事件发生了，没事就好”"}
{"time": 1756655940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692708201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“疑似遇见了袭击事件，不过...让他们两开枪解决了。”拧着眉说明"}
{"time": 1756656020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21054207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "让夏虫提醒一下以后这类事件可能的应对情况"}
{"time": 1756656044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800467924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“开枪解决吗？之前发生过的袭击事件开枪可没法解决啊，能否详细说明一下”吴连长先是苦笑，然后严肃地向顾营长询问"}
{"time": 1756656087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "872152277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“吴连长，如果再有此类事件发生，就喊弟兄们不要慌，保持冷静立刻闭眼抱头蹲下”"}
{"time": 1756656133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1943653189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“那前兆呢，有什么前兆吗”"}
{"time": 1756656191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430850110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "“如果突然感觉到背后有异样的寒意，不论身处何处，立刻蹲下，如果担心自己会害怕，可以闭上眼睛”"}
{"time": 1756656308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532624030", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“蹲下不动吗，”他看向角落里还在害怕得一动不动的赵九明“那可真是…有一个好运的小子啊。感谢你们的情报，我马上通知全营！”"}
{"time": 1756656345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063615124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "一旁提醒“也可以试着保持冷静不要回头，互相面对或侧身着，向其他人的背后开枪，不过最好不要离得太近或者和他人背后的尸体对视？”"}
{"time": 1756656377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1602864883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“至少我们这次是通过这样解决的，不保证成功率？”"}
{"time": 1756656397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359325737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "*走过去安抚赵九明“别害怕，杀害弟兄们的凶手已经被我们击杀了，刚刚的枪声你也听到了，等你理清思路了，可以再和我好好谈谈吗？”"}
{"time": 1756656523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "224003265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我其实觉得并不是相同的事情。”皱着眉，“不可能之前不能开枪解决，这一次就可以了”"}
{"time": 1756656524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164382826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "赵九明张了张口想要回应你，但过量的恐惧让他牙齿打颤，半天吐不出一个字，只能点了点头"}
{"time": 1756656597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457913667", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=164382826]*安抚性地在头上摸了摸“都过去了，如果你愿意的话，我可以给你一点东西让你安睡”"}
{"time": 1756656614, "type": "recv", "message_id": "758626107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇摇头，“这事总感觉玄乎，老哥我真想不到什么解决办法。”小声，靠在墙边和连长说话"}
{"time": 1756656629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118582594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "（这时代的镇定剂，好像是成瘾性的来着）"}
{"time": 1756656647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "863995768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "（我可以给点麻药）"}
{"time": 1756656648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "615345692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“也有道理，几个小时前那一次没人带枪，那以前呢？总不会每次都没人开枪，也每次所有人都急着回头吧？当然也有这种可能性就是了……”"}
{"time": 1756656666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514694000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "（我查一下镇定剂）"}
{"time": 1756656676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577464200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "（应该这个时候有安定了）"}
{"time": 1756656729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90391249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "2039502134"}, "sender": {"id": "2039502134", "name": "清词"}, "message": "（1832年就有水合氯醛了，给这个倒霉孩子来一针吧）"}
{"time": 1756656815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267969915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“老哥实不相瞒，营内的袭击事件是最近一周才开始的，营长在第一轮袭击就不幸丧命了。所以才由我来暂时负责这个营”吴连长先是吩咐过来的士兵散了，并且把情报传递出去，而后和顾营长靠在一起低声交谈"}
{"time": 1756656884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121842034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样...\"有些诧异，\"老弟有没有统计过受害者的相同点，我看大家伙都是这么调查的"}
{"time": 1756656894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357138797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“之前骑兵营那边据我所知就和我们这的情况不太一样，死者既有撕裂伤的，也有枪伤的，边境倒是都死于枪伤”"}
{"time": 1756656958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "267934004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"第一次死个营长，难怪...这事压下去了吗？\""}
{"time": 1756657015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "111189506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“完全没有活口啊，压也压不下去。虽然伤亡每次都不是很严重，但这样下去兄弟们不哗变都是训练有素了”"}
{"time": 1756657110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1464013002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"看来这事还拖不得，死者名单有吗\""}
{"time": 1756657217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335478550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "“有的，就在我身上”他把死难者名单递给了你"}
{"time": 1756657378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79579762", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "打开看一眼"}
{"time": 1756657475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676864092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "这是混编团的人员名单，包括骑兵营二营和三营，上面有些人的名字被画了红线，边上写着日期"}
{"time": 1756657533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795940770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "有些人的名字明显更长，应该是蒙古人或者来自其他少数民族"}
{"time": 1756657621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902503574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "摇头，不知道该说什么，\"今天先这样吧，去住处。\""}
{"time": 1756657652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323396722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1057762086", "user_id": "458095233"}, "sender": {"id": "458095233", "name": "风铃浅唱"}, "message": "。log off"}
